+          <dt pn="section-6.2-4.37">missing_extension:</dt>
+          <dd pn="section-6.2-4.38">Sent by endpoints that receive a handshake
+message not containing an extension that is mandatory to send for
+the offered TLS version or other negotiated parameters.</dd>
+          <dt pn="section-6.2-4.39">unsupported_extension:</dt>
+          <dd pn="section-6.2-4.40">Sent by endpoints receiving any handshake
+message containing an extension known to be prohibited for
+inclusion in the given handshake message, or including any
+extensions in a ServerHello or Certificate not first offered in
+the corresponding ClientHello or CertificateRequest.</dd>
+          <dt pn="section-6.2-4.41">unrecognized_name:</dt>
+          <dd pn="section-6.2-4.42">Sent by servers when no server exists identified
+by the name provided by the client via the &quot;server_name&quot; extension
