+&quot;status_request&quot; extension (see <xref target="RFC6066" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="RFC6066"/>).</dd>
+          <dt pn="section-6.2-4.45">unknown_psk_identity:</dt>
+          <dd pn="section-6.2-4.46">Sent by servers when PSK key establishment is
